  The parenting plan (MON-5).

  The section and question wording is this project's, covering the areas § 858 of the Czech
  občanský zákoník names as parental responsibility plus the practical headings the Ministry of
  Justice's own parenting-plan page lists. It is deliberately NOT a copy of that Ministry form —
  see ParentingPlanCatalogue, and parenting_plan_disclaimer, which says so to the user.
-->
